"Grol nuktauru! Trort ugga!" at first Doyle's voice trembles, but then he pulls himself together and pronounces this gibberish quite menacingly.
You don't know what that means, but feel that it takes effect upon savages. You bring the torch to the lighter, bright fire blazes up, illuminating frightened painted faces. One of the natives try to look brave. He has a high headwear of motley bird feathers, evidently this is the chief of the tribe or the shaman.